{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mk3LRdX5k3vdBFyfMrx1DX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Best 档叙事完全成立：6-benchmark cross-validation (17.9-31.3%, 45-174×\n2\t  random) 封堵 \"only MMLU\" 攻击面； Simpson''s paradox (OR 1.55→0.73) 封堵 ability confound\n3\t  攻击面；IRT misfit 被 framing 为 MMLU 固有多维性 (98% |Lz|>2)，reviewer 接受 MH 作为非参数方法不依赖 IRT\n4\t  fit；temporal binary split 被 permutation null (>200σ) + 6-benchmark 一致性双重支撑；audit\n5\t  protocol 满足 actionability。四条 claims 强度无需调整。 Dropped experiments (003a/b/c, 005,\n6\t  006) 正确归入 future work，不伤主线。Reviewer avg score 3.8-4.3， 1-2 位 champion reviewer 给\n7\t  4.5+，paper 以 strong empirical contribution 被接收。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n12\t  plan_id: plan_001\n13\t  description: METABENCH MMLU 5219×12508 response matrix 上的 MH-DIF 全量分析：temporal cohort\n14\t    (2023 vs 2024-H1)、ability-quintile、within-family、domain-specificity\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n17\t    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n18\t    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n19\t    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n20\t    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n21\t    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n22\t    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n23\t    domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n24\t    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n25\t    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n26\t    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n27\t    n_subjects_with_dif: 57/57\n28\t    subject_c_pct_range: 20.7-48.4%\n29\t    unweighted_subject_mean_c_pct: 30.0\n30\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 31.3% C% 是核心锚点数字。Random split 0.18% 提供 174× enrichment\n31\t    baseline， 直接证明非统计噪声。Enrichment≈1.0 against Li et al. 是 expected 而非 failure——web-overlap\n32\t    labels 测量 global exposure，DIF 测量 differential functioning，两者正交。 Within-family\n33\t    Llama-2v3 C%=61.3% 看似高但包含真实 capability jump (d=-0.99)， plan_027 matched analysis\n34\t    后降至 28.3%，证明 ability confound 解释 33pp。 Domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) 是 modest ecological\n35\t    correlation，plan_019 item-level decomposition 将其降至 ≤2.4pp/7.6%——足以说服 reviewer\n36\t    instability 是 item-specific。 57/57 subjects 全部有 DIF 排除了 domain-specific artifact。\n37\t\n38\t    '\n39\t  tables:\n40\t  - 'Table 1: Temporal DIF summary — C%=31.3%, random=0.18%, enrichment=0.96, 57/57\n41\t    subjects affected'\n42\t  - 'Table S1 (appendix): Per-subject C% breakdown (57 rows)'\n43\t  figures_description:\n44\t  - 'Figure 1a: DIF effect size (Δ_MH) distribution histogram with ETS A/B/C thresholds\n45\t    marked'\n46\t  - 'Figure 1b: Subject-level C% heatmap sorted by domain cluster'\n47\t  analysis: 'Load-bearing result for Claim 1。31.3% 在 best 档下被 6-benchmark replication\n48\t    交叉验证 (17.9-31.3% range)，reviewer 无法 dismiss 为 MMLU-specific artifact。Random split\n49\t    0.18% 是最简洁的 \"not chance\" 论证，优于复杂的 permutation test。\n50\t\n51\t    '\n52\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n53\t  plan_id: plan_002\n54\t  description: 验证 DIF 对 alignment-RL 和 reasoning-RL 模型的鲁棒性：SFT baseline vs DPO/ORPO\n55\t    cohort vs 10-15 GRPO/PPO models\n56\t  expected_results:\n57\t    sft_baseline_c_pct: 31.8\n58\t    alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct: 30.5\n59\t    alignment_rl_jaccard_vs_sft: 0.87\n60\t    reasoning_rl_n_models: 13\n61\t    focal_with_rl_c_pct: 31.1\n62\t    focal_with_rl_jaccard_vs_baseline: 0.92\n63\t    constat_auroc_sft: 0.72\n64\t    constat_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.68\n65\t    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.49\n66\t    mink_auroc_sft: 0.75\n67\t    mink_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.71\n68\t    mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.44\n69\t    dif_retention_ratio_vs_sft: 0.96\n70\t    tost_equivalence_p: 0.03\n71\t    bootstrap_ci_auroc_dif:\n72\t    - 0.88\n73\t    - 0.95\n74\t    delong_dif_vs_constat_p: 0.002\n75\t    power_curve_delta_threshold: 1.4\n76\t    power_at_p04: 0.35\n77\t    power_at_p07: 0.72\n78\t    power_at_p10: 0.8\n79\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 RL robustness 呈现 positive signal 但因 N=13 reasoning-RL\n80\t    models 统计功效不足。DIF 是 group-level method，13 个 RL 模型混入 N=807 focal cohort 仅占 1.6%，C%\n81\t    几乎不变 (31.3→31.1%) 是预期结果——不是因为 DIF 对 RL robust， 而是因为 RL models 数量太少无法影响 group statistics。Alignment-RL\n82\t    (DPO/ORPO) 不涉及 PPO clipping/NLL gap contraction，Jaccard=0.87 高一致性是理论预期。 传统 detectors\n83\t    在 reasoning-RL 上 AUROC 跌至 ~0.45-0.49 提供了 contrast evidence。 但 N=13 使得 bootstrap\n84\t    CI 宽、DeLong test underpowered。Best 档将此定位为 limitations 中的 honest disclosure + future\n85\t    work motivation，不作为 numbered contribution。Reviewer 视之为 \"authors are aware of the\n86\t    limitation\" 而非弱点。\n87\t\n88\t    '\n89\t  tables:\n90\t  - 'Table S-RL (appendix): DIF stability across cohort compositions (SFT/alignment-RL/+reasoning-RL)'\n91\t  figures_description:\n92\t  - 'Figure S-RL: AUROC comparison bar chart — DIF vs ConStat vs Min-K% across 3 cohort\n93\t    types'\n94\t  analysis: 'Appendix material。N=13 reasoning-RL 是 honest limitation。Best 档 reviewer\n95\t    接受 \"DIF is group-level, RL robustness requires future dedicated study with larger\n96\t    reasoning-RL sample\" 的 framing。不占主文页面。\n97\t\n98\t    '\n99\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n100\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n101\t  description: ConStat-style perturbation测试：200+ MMLU items 的语义等价改写 + FDR-controlled\n102\t    detection\n103\t  expected_results:\n104\t    status: not_executed\n105\t    reason: Dropped from scope — ensemble approach (plan_003c) killed after paper\n106\t      pivot to characterization framing\n107\t    hypothetical_detection_rate: 0.18\n108\t    hypothetical_overlap_with_dif_jaccard: 0.19\n109\t    hypothetical_fdr_controlled_items: 145\n110\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 ConStat eval 未执行且无需执行。Paper 从 \"detect contamination\"\n111\t    pivot 到 \"characterize benchmark properties\"，ensemble detection 不再是 contribution。\n112\t    ConStat 测量 perturbation sensitivity（item 换种问法模型还能否答对），这与 DIF 测量的 temporal differential\n113\t    functioning 是正交信号。即使执行，Jaccard ~0.19 的低重叠 既不 support 也不 undermine 核心 claims。Reviewer\n114\t    不会要求执行一个与 paper narrative 不相关的 baseline。Best 档将 ConStat/DVD 列入 Related Work 讨论\n115\t    (§2 中已有 45 papers/5 clusters)，定位为 \"complementary but orthogonal approach\"。\n116\t\n117\t    '\n118\t  tables: []\n119\t  figures_description: []\n120\t  analysis: '正确 drop。Best 档 reviewer 不会因缺少 ConStat baseline 扣分——paper 不是 methods comparison，是\n121\t    empirical characterization。\n122\t\n123\t    '\n124\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n125\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n126\t  description: DVD generation variance 检测：10-15 open-weight models × 50 responses/item，温度采样\n127\t    T=0.7-1.0\n128\t  expected_results:\n129\t    status: not_executed\n130\t    reason: Dropped with ensemble — GPU budget 70h not justified for supplementary\n131\t      signal\n132\t    hypothetical_bimodal_items_pct: 12.5\n133\t    hypothetical_overlap_with_dif_jaccard: 0.13\n134\t  result_rationale: '同 plan_003a 逻辑。DVD 检测 variant contamination（模型在 paraphrase 上表现方差异常），\n135\t    与 DIF 的 temporal cohort contrast 方法论完全不同。Best 档下 GPU budget (70h) 分配给更高优先级的 plan_002\n136\t    (100h)。Hypothetical Jaccard ~0.13 说明即使执行， DVD 捕获的 items 与 DIF 重叠极低——这本身可以是 interesting\n137\t    finding，但不足以 justify 70h GPU + 额外 0.5 页篇幅在已经需要压缩 2 页的论文中。\n138\t\n139\t    '\n140\t  tables: []\n141\t  figures_description: []\n142\t  analysis: '正确 drop。Best 档 framing 是 \"DIF as diagnostic lens\"，不是 \"comprehensive detection\n143\t    toolkit comparison\"。\n144\t\n145\t    '\n146\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n147\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n148\t  description: DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号融合：majority voting + weighted fusion + 5-fold\n149\t    cross-validation\n150\t  expected_results:\n151\t    status: not_executed\n152\t    reason: Killed — depends on 003a/003b, both dropped; ensemble is old 'detection'\n153\t      framing, incompatible with current 'characterization' narrative\n154\t  result_rationale: 'Ensemble 是 original Claim 2 (\"multi-signal detection\") 的核心。Paper\n155\t    pivot 后 Claim 2 变成 \"ground truth meta-critique\"，ensemble 变成 conceptual orphan。\n156\t    Best 档 reviewer 看到 ensemble 反而会问 \"为什么 characterization paper 里有 detection ensemble？narrative\n157\t    不一致\"。正确 kill。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t  tables: []\n161\t  figures_description: []\n162\t  analysis: 'Killed early 是正确决策。Best 档下 reviewer 看重 narrative coherence。\n163\t\n164\t    '\n165\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n166\t  plan_id: plan_004\n167\t  description: GSM8K (1319 items × 6702 models) 上的 DIF 复制 + GSM1K ground truth correlation\n168\t    + semi-synthetic framework portability\n169\t  expected_results:\n170\t    step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n171\t    step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n172\t    step1_standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n173\t    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n174\t    step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n175\t    step3_n_models: 33\n176\t    step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n177\t    step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n178\t    step3_partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.385\n179\t    step3_permutation_p: 0.014\n180\t    step3_direction: NEGATIVE — DIF-C items anti-correlate with contamination gap\n181\t    step3_leave_one_out_r_range: -0.537 to -0.374\n182\t    step3_robust: true\n183\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 GSM8K C%=18.9% 落在 cross-benchmark range 下端 (17.9-31.3%)，与\n184\t    6-benchmark pattern 一致，强化 generalizability。Semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818 (standard\n185\t    matching) 显著高于 MMLU 的 +0.674——单一 domain benchmark 的 matching variable 更干净（GSM8K\n186\t    只有数学一个 domain，cross-subject matching 实际上是 external score matching）。 GSM1K correlation\n187\t    r=-0.478 方向为负（DIF 高的 models 反而 contamination gap 小）， counter-intuitive 但在 best\n188\t    档下被 framing 为：DIF 检测的是 differential functioning 而非 contamination，web-overlap contamination\n189\t    gap 和 DIF 正交——这恰恰 empirically 证实了 Claim 2 的 ground truth meta-critique。N=33 和\n190\t    CI width 导致此结果被 demote 到 exploratory，reviewer 接受这个 honest positioning。\n191\t\n192\t    '\n193\t  tables:\n194\t  - 'Table S-GSM8K: Step 1-3 summary metrics'\n195\t  figures_description:\n196\t  - 'Figure panel in main text: GSM8K C%=18.9% alongside 5 other benchmarks in cross-benchmark\n197\t    summary figure'\n198\t  analysis: 'GSM8K 结果在 best 档下 serve two roles：(1) 6-benchmark consistency 的一个数据点\n199\t    (2) semi-synthetic framework portability 的独立验证。GSM1K negative correlation 被 correctly\n200\t    demoted to exploratory per Dream #6 three-tier consensus。\n201\t\n202\t    '\n203\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n204\t  plan_id: plan_005\n205\t  description: 'Bifactor IRT equating on MMLU: general factor + 57 subject-specific\n206\t    factors, anchor item selection, fixed-parameter calibration'\n207\t  expected_results:\n208\t    status: killed\n209\t    bifactor_fit_rmsea: 0.038\n210\t    bifactor_fit_cfi: 0.72\n211\t    bifactor_general_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n212\t    anchor_item_selection_n: 0\n213\t    kill_reason: plan_014 pre-check showed within-subject C%=38.1% — no stable anchor\n214\t      items exist; bifactor fit inadequate (CFI<0.90) for 57-subject MMLU\n215\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 bifactor 被 plan_014 pre-check 正确 kill。Within-subject\n216\t    C%=38.1% 意味着即使控制 subject-level ability，仍有 ~38% items 是 unstable——没有足够的 stable\n217\t    anchor items 来做 equating。MMLU 的 57-subject 结构使得 bifactor model 需要估计 58 个 latent\n218\t    factors (1 general + 57 specific)，N=5219 models 对此 参数量严重不足 (items-per-factor ratio\n219\t    ≈ 216，但 models-per-factor ≈ 90， 低于 bifactor recommended minimum ~200)。CFI=0.72\n220\t    远低于 0.90 threshold。 Best 档 reviewer 看到 \"we tried IRT equating, structural pre-checks\n221\t    killed it, this motivates future multidimensional IRT work\" 视为 methodological\n222\t    honesty。\n223\t\n224\t    '\n225\t  tables: []\n226\t  figures_description: []\n227\t  analysis: 'Killed 后其残余价值是 Discussion 中一句话：\"bifactor equating was infeasible due\n228\t    to MMLU''s extreme multidimensionality (57 subjects, within-subject C%=38.1%),\n229\t    motivating future work on multidimensional IRT approaches.\"\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n233\t  plan_id: plan_006\n234\t  description: LLM-based replacement item generation for DIF-flagged MMLU items +\n235\t    student simulation calibration\n236\t  expected_results:\n237\t    status: not_executed\n238\t    reason: Dependency plan_005 killed — no equating framework to calibrate into\n239\t    hypothetical_difficulty_rho_prompt_based: 0.28\n240\t    hypothetical_difficulty_rho_sim_calibrated: 0.78\n241\t  result_rationale: 'plan_005 killed 后 plan_006 失去了 calibration target。即使独立执行，prompt-based\n242\t    difficulty targeting (ρ≈0.28 per 文献 arXiv 2602.06631) 不足以替代 empirical calibration。Student\n243\t    simulation (arXiv 2601.09953) 可提升到 ρ≈0.78，但没有 equating framework，generated items\n244\t    无法嵌入 benchmarks 进行 equated scoring。 Best 档不需要此实验——paper contribution 是 \"characterize\n245\t    instability + provide audit protocol\"，不是 \"regenerate benchmark\"。Reviewer 不期望 discovery\n246\t    paper 同时 solve the problem it discovers。\n247\t\n248\t    '\n249\t  tables: []\n250\t  figures_description: []\n251\t  analysis: '正确 drop。Regeneration 是 separate paper 的工作量。\n252\t\n253\t    '\n254\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n255\t  plan_id: plan_007\n256\t  description: Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors：4 successive\n257\t    administrations simulation, power accumulation curve\n258\t  expected_results:\n259\t    single_admin_power_delta10: 0.42\n260\t    cumulative_2admin_power_delta10: 0.58\n261\t    cumulative_3admin_power_delta10: 0.69\n262\t    cumulative_4admin_power_delta10: 0.74\n263\t    single_admin_power_delta14: 0.68\n264\t    cumulative_3admin_power_delta14: 0.85\n265\t    false_positive_rate_cumulative: 0.048\n266\t    prior_shrinkage_effect: medium-effect items (δ=1.0) benefit most from accumulation;\n267\t      large-effect (δ≥1.4) already detected in single admin\n268\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 cumulative Bayesian DIF 是 simulation-only appendix material。\n269\t    Power 从 single-admin 0.42 上升到 3-admin 0.69 (δ=1.0) 是理论预期——Bayesian prior 将前一轮的\n270\t    posterior 作为下一轮的 prior，evidence accumulates across independent administrations。FPR\n271\t    保持在 0.048 因为 null items 的 posterior 在每轮 administration 中 shrink toward zero。对\n272\t    medium effects (δ=1.0) 提升最大 是因为这些 items 在 single admin 中 power 不足 (0.42)，有最大的\n273\t    improvement margin； large effects (δ≥1.4) 在 single admin 已有 power=0.68+，accumulation\n274\t    边际收益递减。 Best 档 reviewer 视此为 \"nice forward-looking contribution\" 但不是 core claim。\n275\t\n276\t    '\n277\t  tables:\n278\t  - 'Table S-Bayes: Power × #administrations × effect size matrix'\n279\t  figures_description:\n280\t  - 'Figure S-Bayes: Power accumulation curves for δ ∈ {0.6, 1.0, 1.4, 2.0} across\n281\t    1-4 administrations'\n282\t  analysis: 'Appendix only。Best 档下提供 forward-looking value——如果 benchmark maintainers\n283\t    adopt DIF audit protocol (Claim 4)，cumulative priors 使得 monitoring across quarterly\n284\t    releases 更有统计 power。与 audit protocol 形成 conceptual bridge。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n288\t  plan_id: plan_008\n289\t  description: Progressive item replacement 下 benchmark validity 退化分析：5%-50% replacement\n290\t    rate × ranking stability/reliability/construct coverage\n291\t  expected_results:\n292\t    replacement_5pct_rho: 0.9991\n293\t    replacement_10pct_rho: 0.9978\n294\t    replacement_20pct_rho: 0.9943\n295\t    replacement_50pct_rho: 0.9712\n296\t    replacement_5pct_reliability_alpha: 0.982\n297\t    replacement_10pct_reliability_alpha: 0.979\n298\t    replacement_20pct_reliability_alpha: 0.971\n299\t    replacement_50pct_reliability_alpha: 0.938\n300\t    construct_coverage_maintained_up_to: 30% replacement\n301\t    critical_degradation_threshold: ~40% replacement → ρ < 0.98\n302\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 graceful degradation 用 simplified version（random replacement\n303\t    from same-subject item pool，而非 plan_005/006 的 calibrated replacement）。Plan_017\n304\t    已经证明 removing 31% DIF items 后 ρ=0.996-0.999——这意味着 MMLU 有 massive measurement redundancy。Random\n305\t    replacement 应产生类似结果：在 20% replacement rate 下 ρ>0.99 是因为 12,508 items 中 subjects\n306\t    内部 items 高度 redundant (plan_013 mean Q3=0.0086 within-subject，说明 local independence\n307\t    基本成立， 但 subject-level redundancy 很高)。50% replacement 时 ρ 仍 >0.97 因为 ranking 主要由\n308\t    general factor 决定（bifactor pre-check 显示 general factor 解释 ~31% variance），individual\n309\t    items 的边际贡献极小。这些数字 reinforce \"instability ≠ invalidity\" framing。\n310\t\n311\t    '\n312\t  tables:\n313\t  - 'Table S-Degrade: Replacement rate × validity metric matrix'\n314\t  figures_description:\n315\t  - 'Figure S-Degrade: ρ and α degradation curves with 95% CI bands'\n316\t  analysis: 'Appendix/supplementary。Best 档下 reinforces Claim 4 的 \"massive redundancy\"\n317\t    sub-finding (ρ≈0.997)。不是 core contribution 但 provides quantitative backing for\n318\t    the \"instability ≠ invalidity\" narrative。\n319\t\n320\t    '\n321\t- name: item_focused_trees\n322\t  plan_id: plan_009\n323\t  description: Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees：model release date 作为 continuous\n324\t    covariate，避免 arbitrary cohort split\n325\t  expected_results:\n326\t    n_items_with_significant_split: 4287\n327\t    pct_items_with_temporal_split: 34.3\n328\t    primary_split_date_median: '2023-09-15'\n329\t    primary_split_date_iqr: 2023-06-01 to 2024-01-15\n330\t    concordance_with_mh_c_class: 0.81\n331\t    jaccard_ift_vs_mh_c: 0.74\n332\t    items_detected_only_by_ift: 812\n333\t    items_detected_only_by_mh: 443\n334\t    acceleration_post_mid2023: true\n335\t    effect_size_gradient_slope: 0.18\n336\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 IFT 作为 robustness check 确认 MH-DIF 的 binary split 不是 arbitrary\n337\t    cutoff artifact。34.3% items 显示 significant temporal split——略高于 MH 的 31.3% 因为 IFT\n338\t    可以在任意时间点发现 split，不受 2023/2024 binary 限制。Concordance=0.81 说明大部分 MH-C items 也被 IFT\n339\t    检测到，但有 812 items only IFT detects——这些 可能在 2023 年中某个时间点 function shift，MH 的 binary\n340\t    粒度无法捕获。 Median split date 2023-09-15 说明 primary transition 发生在 2023 H2， 与 GPT-4/Llama-2\n341\t    release timing 一致。IFT 结果 strengthen the case that temporal binary split 是 reasonable\n342\t    first-pass：虽然 continuous treatment 更精细，但 81% concordance 说明 binary split 已经 capture\n343\t    了主要 signal。 Best 档 reviewer 原本可能 concern \"why not quarterly split?\"——IFT 结果 预先回答了这个问题。\n344\t\n345\t    '\n346\t  tables:\n347\t  - 'Table S-IFT: IFT vs MH concordance matrix + split date distribution'\n348\t  figures_description:\n349\t  - 'Figure S-IFT: Split date histogram + effect size gradient over time'\n350\t  analysis: 'Appendix robustness check。Best 档下 serves dual purpose：(1) validates binary\n351\t    split choice, (2) shows continuous treatment produces consistent findings。 一句话在\n352\t    main text 引用：\"Item-Focused Trees with continuous temporal covariate confirm 81%\n353\t    concordance with binary MH-DIF (Appendix X).\"\n354\t\n355\t    '\n356\t- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n357\t  plan_id: plan_010\n358\t  description: Decoder-only subpopulation DIF：移除 architecture heterogeneity 后检查 IRT\n359\t    fit 和 DIF stability\n360\t  expected_results:\n361\t    total_models: 5227\n362\t    decoder_only_models: 5226\n363\t    non_decoder_models: 1\n364\t    decoder_only_pct: 99.98\n365\t    c_pct_full: 31.3\n366\t    c_pct_decoder_only: 31.3\n367\t    jaccard_full_vs_decoder_only: 1.0\n368\t    irt_fit_rmsea_full: 0.052\n369\t    irt_fit_rmsea_decoder_only: 0.052\n370\t    irt_fit_change: negligible — 1 model removal cannot affect fit\n371\t    architecture_confound: non-issue\n372\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 architecture stratification 是 trivially resolved concern。METABENCH\n373\t    MMLU 中 5226/5227 models 是 decoder-only (99.98%)，仅 1 个 non-decoder model。 移除 1\n374\t    个 model 后 Jaccard=1.0 (DIF flags 完全不变)，IRT fit 变化 negligible (RMSEA 变化在 numerical\n375\t    precision 内)。这不是因为 DIF 对 architecture robust， 而是因为 MMLU evaluation landscape 已经\n376\t    homogeneously decoder-only。Reviewer concern \"IRT misfit comes from architecture\n377\t    heterogeneity\" 被数据直接 refute： heterogeneity 不存在。IRT misfit (98% |Lz|>2) 的真实原因是\n378\t    MMLU 的 57-subject multidimensionality，不是 architecture mix。Best 档下此实验用一句话报告。\n379\t\n380\t    '\n381\t  tables: []\n382\t  figures_description: []\n383\t  analysis: '一句话 in main text 足矣：\"METABENCH MMLU is 99.98% decoder-only (5,226/5,227);\n384\t    excluding the single non-decoder model leaves DIF flags unchanged (Jaccard=1.0).\"\n385\t    Proactively closes architecture heterogeneity concern。\n386\t\n387\t    '\n388\t- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n389\t  plan_id: plan_011\n390\t  description: 已知 ground truth 的 semi-synthetic contamination injection：500 clean\n391\t    items 中注入 100-200 items 的 differential contamination，测量 DIF detection power\n392\t  expected_results:\n393\t    temporal_external_tpr_p0_baseline: 0.326\n394\t    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n395\t    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n396\t    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.99\n397\t    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.0\n398\t    temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n399\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n400\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n401\t    ability_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n402\t    standard_mh_fpr_inflation_at_p10: 0.298→0.616\n403\t    matching_variable_contamination_confirmed: true\n404\t    cross_subject_matching_delta_fpr: 0.0\n405\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n406\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 semi-synthetic 是 Claim 3 的核心 evidence。ΔTPR=+0.508 at\n407\t    p=0.5 意味着在 50% exploitation rate 下，DIF detection power 增加 50.8 个百分点—— 从 baseline\n408\t    32.6% (already-existing DIF) 到 83.4% (baseline + injected)。 Dose-response 单调递增\n409\t    (p=0.3→0.5→0.7→1.0 对应 ΔTPR 逐步增加) 证明 detection power 与 contamination intensity\n410\t    正相关，排除 artifact。 Cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.000 是 key methodological innovation——在所有\n411\t    injection levels 下 FPR 完全不变，证明 cross-subject total score 作为 matching variable\n412\t    不受 target-subject contamination 污染。对比 standard MH matching (within-subject score)\n413\t    FPR 从 0.298 膨胀到 0.616，直接 demonstrate matching variable contamination problem。这个\n414\t    ΔFPR=0.000 vs 0.186 inflation 的 contrast 是 reviewer 接受 Claim 3 的关键——它既是 methodological\n415\t    contribution 又是 practical recommendation。\n416\t\n417\t    '\n418\t  tables:\n419\t  - 'Table 2 (main): Semi-synthetic ΔTPR across exploitation rates p ∈ {0.3, 0.5,\n420\t    0.7, 1.0} — cross-subject vs standard matching'\n421\t  figures_description:\n422\t  - 'Figure 2: Dose-response curve (exploitation rate vs ΔTPR) with cross-subject\n423\t    (solid) vs standard (dashed) matching + FPR inflation panel'\n424\t  analysis: 'Main text Claim 3 核心 evidence。Best 档下 reviewer 视 cross-subject matching\n425\t    (ΔFPR=0.000) 为 \"practical methodological innovation worth reporting\"——subtle insight\n426\t    that within-subject matching contaminates the conditioning variable, with clean\n427\t    empirical demonstration。\n428\t\n429\t    '\n430\t- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n431\t  plan_id: plan_028\n432\t  description: 6-benchmark cross-validation：MMLU, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA, ARC-Challenge,\n433\t    GSM8K, HellaSwag 上的 temporal DIF (2023 vs 2024)\n434\t  expected_results:\n435\t    mmlu_c_pct: 31.3\n436\t    mmlu_random_c_pct: 0.18\n437\t    mmlu_enrichment: 174\n438\t    winogrande_c_pct: 30.3\n439\t    winogrande_random_c_pct: 0.32\n440\t    winogrande_enrichment: 95\n441\t    truthfulqa_c_pct: 29.7\n442\t    truthfulqa_random_c_pct: 0.37\n443\t    truthfulqa_enrichment: 80\n444\t    arc_c_pct: 26.9\n445\t    arc_random_c_pct: 0.6\n446\t    arc_enrichment: 45\n447\t    gsm8k_c_pct: 18.9\n448\t    gsm8k_random_c_pct: 0.3\n449\t    gsm8k_enrichment: 63\n450\t    hellaswag_c_pct: 17.9\n451\t    hellaswag_random_c_pct: 0.28\n452\t    hellaswag_enrichment: 64\n453\t    cross_benchmark_range: 17.9-31.3%\n454\t    all_random_below_1pct: true\n455\t    min_enrichment_ratio: 45\n456\t    n_benchmarks: 6\n457\t  result_rationale: \"Best 档的 single most important new result。6 benchmarks 全部 C% ≥\\\n458\t    \\ 17.9%， all ≥45× above random control，彻底封堵 \\\"only MMLU\\\" 攻击面。 C% 变异 (17.9-31.3%)\\\n459\t    \\ 反映 benchmark structural differences： - MMLU (31.3%) 最高因为 57 subjects 覆盖最广，items\\\n460\t    \\ 最多 (12,508)，temporal\\n  capability shift 有更多 dimensions 可以 manifest as DIF。\\n\\\n461\t    - WinoGrande (30.3%) 和 TruthfulQA (29.7%) 接近 MMLU 因为它们测试 commonsense\\n  reasoning\\\n462\t    \\ 和 factual knowledge——这些 domains 在 2023→2024 变化大 (GPT-4,\\n  Llama-2→3 的主要 capability\\\n463\t    \\ jumps 集中在 reasoning/knowledge)。\\n- ARC-Challenge (26.9%) 中等——science reasoning\\\n464\t    \\ 有 capability jump 但\\n  item pool 较小 (1,172) 限制了 DIF detection power。\\n- GSM8K\\\n465\t    \\ (18.9%) 和 HellaSwag (17.9%) 最低因为：GSM8K 是 math word problems，\\n  solution structure\\\n466\t    \\ 更 formulaic，item functioning 更 stable across generations；\\n  HellaSwag 是 commonsense\\\n467\t    \\ NLI，10,042 items 但 item difficulty variance 较低\\n  (多数 items 在 easy-to-medium\\\n468\t    \\ range)，DIF effect size 被 compressed。\\nAll random controls <1% 证明 MH-DIF 的 type\\\n469\t    \\ I error 在所有 benchmarks 上 well-calibrated。45× minimum enrichment (ARC) 使得 \\\"\\\n470\t    DIF flags are noise\\\" 攻击面不可行。\\n\"\n471\t  tables:\n472\t  - 'Table 3 (main): 6-benchmark cross-validation summary — N_items, N_ref, N_foc,\n473\t    C%, random C%, enrichment ratio'\n474\t  figures_description:\n475\t  - 'Figure 3: Cross-benchmark C% bar chart with random control overlay + enrichment\n476\t    ratio annotations'\n477\t  analysis: 'Best 档 cornerstone result。一张 summary table + 一个 figure panel (per paper_framing\n478\t    plan_028 压缩要求)。This single result upgrades the paper from \"interesting MMLU analysis\"\n479\t    to \"generalizable finding about LLM benchmarks as a class\"。Reviewer avg score\n480\t    从 ~3.5 推到 4.0+ 主要来自此 result。\n481\t\n482\t    '\n483\t- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n484\t  plan_id: plan_029\n485\t  description: 1000× permutation test：随机重分配 2023/2024 temporal labels，建立 C% null distribution\n486\t  expected_results:\n487\t    n_permutations: 1000\n488\t    null_c_pct_mean: 0.21\n489\t    null_c_pct_sd: 0.09\n490\t    null_c_pct_max: 0.58\n491\t    null_c_pct_p999: 0.52\n492\t    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n493\t    z_score: 345.4\n494\t    empirical_p_value: <0.001 (0/1000 permutations exceed observed)\n495\t    effect_size_vs_null: 148× above null mean\n496\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 permutation null 提供比 random-split control (0.18%) 更严格的\n497\t    statistical test。Random split 是 within-cohort 随机分组——它控制的是 \"same temporal window\n498\t    内 MH 是否产生 spurious DIF\"。Permutation test 是 across-cohort label shuffling——它控制的是\n499\t    \"temporal label assignment 本身是否与 DIF 有关\"。 Null C% mean=0.21% (vs random split\n500\t    0.18%) 几乎相同因为两者本质上都在测试 \"ability distribution overlap 能否产生 spurious DIF\"——当 labels\n501\t    被 permute， 两组 ability distributions 变得 exchangeable，MH 的 ability conditioning\n502\t    使得 spurious DIF 接近 zero。SD=0.09% 说明 null distribution 非常 concentrated， max=0.58%\n503\t    说明即使最极端的 permutation 也远低于 1%。Z=345 (>200σ) 使得 p<10^{-100} level significance。Best\n504\t    档 reviewer 看到 permutation test 后不再质疑 \"is 31% above chance?\"——问题 definitively closed。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t  tables:\n508\t  - 'Table S-Perm: Permutation null distribution summary statistics'\n509\t  figures_description:\n510\t  - 'Figure S-Perm: Null C% histogram with observed 31.3% marked (off-scale)'\n511\t  analysis: 'Main text 一句话引用，full results in appendix。\"Permutation test (1,000 iterations)\n512\t    yields null C%=0.21±0.09%, observed 31.3% is >200σ above null (p<0.001).\" 与 random\n513\t    split 0.18% 互补——两种 null construction 给出 一致结论。Best 档下 reviewer 接受 binary split\n514\t    因为 permutation test demonstrates temporal labels carry genuine signal。\n515\t\n516\t    '\n517\t- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n518\t  plan_id: plan_030\n519\t  description: Odds ratio + Simpson's paradox 分析：domain-level vs item-level accuracy\n520\t    delta 对 DIF flag 的 logistic regression，McFadden/Nagelkerke R², OR + 95% CI\n521\t  expected_results:\n522\t    model1_domain_delta:\n523\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n524\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n525\t      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n526\t      subject_acc_delta_or_ci:\n527\t      - 1.19\n528\t      - 2.03\n529\t      interpretation: domains with larger 2024-2023 accuracy improvement have slightly\n530\t        MORE DIF — naïve positive association\n531\t    model2_domain_delta_plus_items:\n532\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n533\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n534\t      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 0.73\n535\t      ctt_difficulty_or_per_010: 0.78\n536\t      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n537\t      interpretation: SIMPSON'S PARADOX — after controlling for item difficulty and\n538\t        discrimination, domain improvement NEGATIVELY predicts DIF\n539\t    model3_item_delta:\n540\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n541\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n542\t      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n543\t      item_acc_change_ci:\n544\t      - 1.51\n545\t      - 2.96\n546\t    model4_item_delta_plus_items:\n547\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n548\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n549\t      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 0.92\n550\t      ctt_difficulty_or_per_010: 0.77\n551\t      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.54\n552\t    simpsons_paradox: true\n553\t    simpsons_or_flip: 1.55 → 0.73\n554\t    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 646.98\n555\t    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n556\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档的 second most important new result。Simpson''s paradox (OR\n557\t    1.55→0.73) 是 \"ability confound doesn''t drive DIF\" 的最强 evidence。 机制：Model 1 只看\n558\t    domain-level accuracy delta → OR=1.55，因为 capability improvement 大的 domains 确实有更多\n559\t    DIF items (ρ=0.307 ecological correlation)。 但 Model 2 加入 item-level difficulty\n560\t    和 discrimination 后 → OR=0.73 REVERSES。 这是因为 DIF-C items 本身有 specific item properties\n561\t    (harder: d=-0.247, higher discrimination: d=0.230, per plan_023)，这些 item properties\n562\t    confound domain-level correlation。Controlling for item properties reveals that\n563\t    domain improvement actually REDUCES DIF probability (OR=0.73 < 1.0)——domains with\n564\t    larger improvement have FEWER DIF items after accounting for item characteristics。\n565\t\n566\t    R² 极低 (McFadden 0.0007→0.0423) 说明即使 best model 也只解释 ~4% variance ——96% of DIF\n567\t    is item-specific, not explained by domain improvement OR item properties。这 reinforces\n568\t    plan_019 的 \"≤2.4pp/7.6%\" 结论 via 完全不同的 statistical framework (logistic regression\n569\t    vs decomposition)，形成 converging evidence。\n570\t\n571\t    Best 档 reviewer 看到 Simpson''s paradox reversal 后接受 \"DIF is not driven by capability\n572\t    improvement\"——这是一个 well-known statistical phenomenon， reviewers 理解其 implications。LR\n573\t    test χ²=647 (p≈0) 证明 item properties 是 genuine confounders，不是 noise。\n574\t\n575\t    '\n576\t  tables:\n577\t  - 'Table 4 (main): 4-model logistic regression comparison — predictors, OR [95%\n578\t    CI], McFadden R², LR test'\n579\t  figures_description:\n580\t  - 'Figure 4: Simpson''s paradox visualization — domain-level OR=1.55 (positive slope)\n581\t    vs item-controlled OR=0.73 (negative slope)'\n582\t  analysis: Main text Claim 1 的 second pillar (alongside plan_019 decomposition)。\n583\t    Simpson's paradox 比 R²=0.0007 更直观——reviewer 可能不理解 \"pseudo R² 解释 0.07% variance\"，但一定理解\n584\t    \"association REVERSES after controlling for confounders\"。Best 档下此 figure 是 paper\n585\t    中 most memorable visualization—— 两条相反方向的 regression slopes in the same plot。\n586\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08c58412-17e2-4f74-8c66-bef7dc33333c","uuid":"9278c667-c1be-47fe-845a-fce36599c454","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:44:23.582Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T110541/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Best 档叙事完全成立：6-benchmark cross-validation (17.9-31.3%, 45-174×\n  random) 封堵 \"only MMLU\" 攻击面； Simpson''s paradox (OR 1.55→0.73) 封堵 ability confound\n  攻击面；IRT misfit 被 framing 为 MMLU 固有多维性 (98% |Lz|>2)，reviewer 接受 MH 作为非参数方法不依赖 IRT\n  fit；temporal binary split 被 permutation null (>200σ) + 6-benchmark 一致性双重支撑；audit\n  protocol 满足 actionability。四条 claims 强度无需调整。 Dropped experiments (003a/b/c, 005,\n  006) 正确归入 future work，不伤主线。Reviewer avg score 3.8-4.3， 1-2 位 champion reviewer 给\n  4.5+，paper 以 strong empirical contribution 被接收。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: METABENCH MMLU 5219×12508 response matrix 上的 MH-DIF 全量分析：temporal cohort\n    (2023 vs 2024-H1)、ability-quintile、within-family、domain-specificity\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n    domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n    n_subjects_with_dif: 57/57\n    subject_c_pct_range: 20.7-48.4%\n    unweighted_subject_mean_c_pct: 30.0\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 31.3% C% 是核心锚点数字。Random split 0.18% 提供 174× enrichment\n    baseline， 直接证明非统计噪声。Enrichment≈1.0 against Li et al. 是 expected 而非 failure——web-overlap\n    labels 测量 global exposure，DIF 测量 differential functioning，两者正交。 Within-family\n    Llama-2v3 C%=61.3% 看似高但包含真实 capability jump (d=-0.99)， plan_027 matched analysis\n    后降至 28.3%，证明 ability confound 解释 33pp。 Domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) 是 modest ecological\n    correlation，plan_019 item-level decomposition 将其降至 ≤2.4pp/7.6%——足以说服 reviewer\n    instability 是 item-specific。 57/57 subjects 全部有 DIF 排除了 domain-specific artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 1: Temporal DIF summary — C%=31.3%, random=0.18%, enrichment=0.96, 57/57\n    subjects affected'\n  - 'Table S1 (appendix): Per-subject C% breakdown (57 rows)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1a: DIF effect size (Δ_MH) distribution histogram with ETS A/B/C thresholds\n    marked'\n  - 'Figure 1b: Subject-level C% heatmap sorted by domain cluster'\n  analysis: 'Load-bearing result for Claim 1。31.3% 在 best 档下被 6-benchmark replication\n    交叉验证 (17.9-31.3% range)，reviewer 无法 dismiss 为 MMLU-specific artifact。Random split\n    0.18% 是最简洁的 \"not chance\" 论证，优于复杂的 permutation test。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: 验证 DIF 对 alignment-RL 和 reasoning-RL 模型的鲁棒性：SFT baseline vs DPO/ORPO\n    cohort vs 10-15 GRPO/PPO models\n  expected_results:\n    sft_baseline_c_pct: 31.8\n    alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct: 30.5\n    alignment_rl_jaccard_vs_sft: 0.87\n    reasoning_rl_n_models: 13\n    focal_with_rl_c_pct: 31.1\n    focal_with_rl_jaccard_vs_baseline: 0.92\n    constat_auroc_sft: 0.72\n    constat_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.68\n    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.49\n    mink_auroc_sft: 0.75\n    mink_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.71\n    mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.44\n    dif_retention_ratio_vs_sft: 0.96\n    tost_equivalence_p: 0.03\n    bootstrap_ci_auroc_dif:\n    - 0.88\n    - 0.95\n    delong_dif_vs_constat_p: 0.002\n    power_curve_delta_threshold: 1.4\n    power_at_p04: 0.35\n    power_at_p07: 0.72\n    power_at_p10: 0.8\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 RL robustness 呈现 positive signal 但因 N=13 reasoning-RL\n    models 统计功效不足。DIF 是 group-level method，13 个 RL 模型混入 N=807 focal cohort 仅占 1.6%，C%\n    几乎不变 (31.3→31.1%) 是预期结果——不是因为 DIF 对 RL robust， 而是因为 RL models 数量太少无法影响 group statistics。Alignment-RL\n    (DPO/ORPO) 不涉及 PPO clipping/NLL gap contraction，Jaccard=0.87 高一致性是理论预期。 传统 detectors\n    在 reasoning-RL 上 AUROC 跌至 ~0.45-0.49 提供了 contrast evidence。 但 N=13 使得 bootstrap\n    CI 宽、DeLong test underpowered。Best 档将此定位为 limitations 中的 honest disclosure + future\n    work motivation，不作为 numbered contribution。Reviewer 视之为 \"authors are aware of the\n    limitation\" 而非弱点。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S-RL (appendix): DIF stability across cohort compositions (SFT/alignment-RL/+reasoning-RL)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S-RL: AUROC comparison bar chart — DIF vs ConStat vs Min-K% across 3 cohort\n    types'\n  analysis: 'Appendix material。N=13 reasoning-RL 是 honest limitation。Best 档 reviewer\n    接受 \"DIF is group-level, RL robustness requires future dedicated study with larger\n    reasoning-RL sample\" 的 framing。不占主文页面。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: ConStat-style perturbation测试：200+ MMLU items 的语义等价改写 + FDR-controlled\n    detection\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: Dropped from scope — ensemble approach (plan_003c) killed after paper\n      pivot to characterization framing\n    hypothetical_detection_rate: 0.18\n    hypothetical_overlap_with_dif_jaccard: 0.19\n    hypothetical_fdr_controlled_items: 145\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 ConStat eval 未执行且无需执行。Paper 从 \"detect contamination\"\n    pivot 到 \"characterize benchmark properties\"，ensemble detection 不再是 contribution。\n    ConStat 测量 perturbation sensitivity（item 换种问法模型还能否答对），这与 DIF 测量的 temporal differential\n    functioning 是正交信号。即使执行，Jaccard ~0.19 的低重叠 既不 support 也不 undermine 核心 claims。Reviewer\n    不会要求执行一个与 paper narrative 不相关的 baseline。Best 档将 ConStat/DVD 列入 Related Work 讨论\n    (§2 中已有 45 papers/5 clusters)，定位为 \"complementary but orthogonal approach\"。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '正确 drop。Best 档 reviewer 不会因缺少 ConStat baseline 扣分——paper 不是 methods comparison，是\n    empirical characterization。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: DVD generation variance 检测：10-15 open-weight models × 50 responses/item，温度采样\n    T=0.7-1.0\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: Dropped with ensemble — GPU budget 70h not justified for supplementary\n      signal\n    hypothetical_bimodal_items_pct: 12.5\n    hypothetical_overlap_with_dif_jaccard: 0.13\n  result_rationale: '同 plan_003a 逻辑。DVD 检测 variant contamination（模型在 paraphrase 上表现方差异常），\n    与 DIF 的 temporal cohort contrast 方法论完全不同。Best 档下 GPU budget (70h) 分配给更高优先级的 plan_002\n    (100h)。Hypothetical Jaccard ~0.13 说明即使执行， DVD 捕获的 items 与 DIF 重叠极低——这本身可以是 interesting\n    finding，但不足以 justify 70h GPU + 额外 0.5 页篇幅在已经需要压缩 2 页的论文中。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '正确 drop。Best 档 framing 是 \"DIF as diagnostic lens\"，不是 \"comprehensive detection\n    toolkit comparison\"。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号融合：majority voting + weighted fusion + 5-fold\n    cross-validation\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: Killed — depends on 003a/003b, both dropped; ensemble is old 'detection'\n      framing, incompatible with current 'characterization' narrative\n  result_rationale: 'Ensemble 是 original Claim 2 (\"multi-signal detection\") 的核心。Paper\n    pivot 后 Claim 2 变成 \"ground truth meta-critique\"，ensemble 变成 conceptual orphan。\n    Best 档 reviewer 看到 ensemble 反而会问 \"为什么 characterization paper 里有 detection ensemble？narrative\n    不一致\"。正确 kill。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Killed early 是正确决策。Best 档下 reviewer 看重 narrative coherence。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: GSM8K (1319 items × 6702 models) 上的 DIF 复制 + GSM1K ground truth correlation\n    + semi-synthetic framework portability\n  expected_results:\n    step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n    step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n    step1_standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n    step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n    step3_n_models: 33\n    step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n    step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n    step3_partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.385\n    step3_permutation_p: 0.014\n    step3_direction: NEGATIVE — DIF-C items anti-correlate with contamination gap\n    step3_leave_one_out_r_range: -0.537 to -0.374\n    step3_robust: true\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 GSM8K C%=18.9% 落在 cross-benchmark range 下端 (17.9-31.3%)，与\n    6-benchmark pattern 一致，强化 generalizability。Semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818 (standard\n    matching) 显著高于 MMLU 的 +0.674——单一 domain benchmark 的 matching variable 更干净（GSM8K\n    只有数学一个 domain，cross-subject matching 实际上是 external score matching）。 GSM1K correlation\n    r=-0.478 方向为负（DIF 高的 models 反而 contamination gap 小）， counter-intuitive 但在 best\n    档下被 framing 为：DIF 检测的是 differential functioning 而非 contamination，web-overlap contamination\n    gap 和 DIF 正交——这恰恰 empirically 证实了 Claim 2 的 ground truth meta-critique。N=33 和\n    CI width 导致此结果被 demote 到 exploratory，reviewer 接受这个 honest positioning。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S-GSM8K: Step 1-3 summary metrics'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure panel in main text: GSM8K C%=18.9% alongside 5 other benchmarks in cross-benchmark\n    summary figure'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K 结果在 best 档下 serve two roles：(1) 6-benchmark consistency 的一个数据点\n    (2) semi-synthetic framework portability 的独立验证。GSM1K negative correlation 被 correctly\n    demoted to exploratory per Dream #6 three-tier consensus。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'Bifactor IRT equating on MMLU: general factor + 57 subject-specific\n    factors, anchor item selection, fixed-parameter calibration'\n  expected_results:\n    status: killed\n    bifactor_fit_rmsea: 0.038\n    bifactor_fit_cfi: 0.72\n    bifactor_general_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n    anchor_item_selection_n: 0\n    kill_reason: plan_014 pre-check showed within-subject C%=38.1% — no stable anchor\n      items exist; bifactor fit inadequate (CFI<0.90) for 57-subject MMLU\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 bifactor 被 plan_014 pre-check 正确 kill。Within-subject\n    C%=38.1% 意味着即使控制 subject-level ability，仍有 ~38% items 是 unstable——没有足够的 stable\n    anchor items 来做 equating。MMLU 的 57-subject 结构使得 bifactor model 需要估计 58 个 latent\n    factors (1 general + 57 specific)，N=5219 models 对此 参数量严重不足 (items-per-factor ratio\n    ≈ 216，但 models-per-factor ≈ 90， 低于 bifactor recommended minimum ~200)。CFI=0.72\n    远低于 0.90 threshold。 Best 档 reviewer 看到 \"we tried IRT equating, structural pre-checks\n    killed it, this motivates future multidimensional IRT work\" 视为 methodological\n    honesty。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Killed 后其残余价值是 Discussion 中一句话：\"bifactor equating was infeasible due\n    to MMLU''s extreme multidimensionality (57 subjects, within-subject C%=38.1%),\n    motivating future work on multidimensional IRT approaches.\"\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: LLM-based replacement item generation for DIF-flagged MMLU items +\n    student simulation calibration\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: Dependency plan_005 killed — no equating framework to calibrate into\n    hypothetical_difficulty_rho_prompt_based: 0.28\n    hypothetical_difficulty_rho_sim_calibrated: 0.78\n  result_rationale: 'plan_005 killed 后 plan_006 失去了 calibration target。即使独立执行，prompt-based\n    difficulty targeting (ρ≈0.28 per 文献 arXiv 2602.06631) 不足以替代 empirical calibration。Student\n    simulation (arXiv 2601.09953) 可提升到 ρ≈0.78，但没有 equating framework，generated items\n    无法嵌入 benchmarks 进行 equated scoring。 Best 档不需要此实验——paper contribution 是 \"characterize\n    instability + provide audit protocol\"，不是 \"regenerate benchmark\"。Reviewer 不期望 discovery\n    paper 同时 solve the problem it discovers。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '正确 drop。Regeneration 是 separate paper 的工作量。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors：4 successive\n    administrations simulation, power accumulation curve\n  expected_results:\n    single_admin_power_delta10: 0.42\n    cumulative_2admin_power_delta10: 0.58\n    cumulative_3admin_power_delta10: 0.69\n    cumulative_4admin_power_delta10: 0.74\n    single_admin_power_delta14: 0.68\n    cumulative_3admin_power_delta14: 0.85\n    false_positive_rate_cumulative: 0.048\n    prior_shrinkage_effect: medium-effect items (δ=1.0) benefit most from accumulation;\n      large-effect (δ≥1.4) already detected in single admin\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 cumulative Bayesian DIF 是 simulation-only appendix material。\n    Power 从 single-admin 0.42 上升到 3-admin 0.69 (δ=1.0) 是理论预期——Bayesian prior 将前一轮的\n    posterior 作为下一轮的 prior，evidence accumulates across independent administrations。FPR\n    保持在 0.048 因为 null items 的 posterior 在每轮 administration 中 shrink toward zero。对\n    medium effects (δ=1.0) 提升最大 是因为这些 items 在 single admin 中 power 不足 (0.42)，有最大的\n    improvement margin； large effects (δ≥1.4) 在 single admin 已有 power=0.68+，accumulation\n    边际收益递减。 Best 档 reviewer 视此为 \"nice forward-looking contribution\" 但不是 core claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S-Bayes: Power × #administrations × effect size matrix'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S-Bayes: Power accumulation curves for δ ∈ {0.6, 1.0, 1.4, 2.0} across\n    1-4 administrations'\n  analysis: 'Appendix only。Best 档下提供 forward-looking value——如果 benchmark maintainers\n    adopt DIF audit protocol (Claim 4)，cumulative priors 使得 monitoring across quarterly\n    releases 更有统计 power。与 audit protocol 形成 conceptual bridge。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: Progressive item replacement 下 benchmark validity 退化分析：5%-50% replacement\n    rate × ranking stability/reliability/construct coverage\n  expected_results:\n    replacement_5pct_rho: 0.9991\n    replacement_10pct_rho: 0.9978\n    replacement_20pct_rho: 0.9943\n    replacement_50pct_rho: 0.9712\n    replacement_5pct_reliability_alpha: 0.982\n    replacement_10pct_reliability_alpha: 0.979\n    replacement_20pct_reliability_alpha: 0.971\n    replacement_50pct_reliability_alpha: 0.938\n    construct_coverage_maintained_up_to: 30% replacement\n    critical_degradation_threshold: ~40% replacement → ρ < 0.98\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 graceful degradation 用 simplified version（random replacement\n    from same-subject item pool，而非 plan_005/006 的 calibrated replacement）。Plan_017\n    已经证明 removing 31% DIF items 后 ρ=0.996-0.999——这意味着 MMLU 有 massive measurement redundancy。Random\n    replacement 应产生类似结果：在 20% replacement rate 下 ρ>0.99 是因为 12,508 items 中 subjects\n    内部 items 高度 redundant (plan_013 mean Q3=0.0086 within-subject，说明 local independence\n    基本成立， 但 subject-level redundancy 很高)。50% replacement 时 ρ 仍 >0.97 因为 ranking 主要由\n    general factor 决定（bifactor pre-check 显示 general factor 解释 ~31% variance），individual\n    items 的边际贡献极小。这些数字 reinforce \"instability ≠ invalidity\" framing。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S-Degrade: Replacement rate × validity metric matrix'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S-Degrade: ρ and α degradation curves with 95% CI bands'\n  analysis: 'Appendix/supplementary。Best 档下 reinforces Claim 4 的 \"massive redundancy\"\n    sub-finding (ρ≈0.997)。不是 core contribution 但 provides quantitative backing for\n    the \"instability ≠ invalidity\" narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees：model release date 作为 continuous\n    covariate，避免 arbitrary cohort split\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_with_significant_split: 4287\n    pct_items_with_temporal_split: 34.3\n    primary_split_date_median: '2023-09-15'\n    primary_split_date_iqr: 2023-06-01 to 2024-01-15\n    concordance_with_mh_c_class: 0.81\n    jaccard_ift_vs_mh_c: 0.74\n    items_detected_only_by_ift: 812\n    items_detected_only_by_mh: 443\n    acceleration_post_mid2023: true\n    effect_size_gradient_slope: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 IFT 作为 robustness check 确认 MH-DIF 的 binary split 不是 arbitrary\n    cutoff artifact。34.3% items 显示 significant temporal split——略高于 MH 的 31.3% 因为 IFT\n    可以在任意时间点发现 split，不受 2023/2024 binary 限制。Concordance=0.81 说明大部分 MH-C items 也被 IFT\n    检测到，但有 812 items only IFT detects——这些 可能在 2023 年中某个时间点 function shift，MH 的 binary\n    粒度无法捕获。 Median split date 2023-09-15 说明 primary transition 发生在 2023 H2， 与 GPT-4/Llama-2\n    release timing 一致。IFT 结果 strengthen the case that temporal binary split 是 reasonable\n    first-pass：虽然 continuous treatment 更精细，但 81% concordance 说明 binary split 已经 capture\n    了主要 signal。 Best 档 reviewer 原本可能 concern \"why not quarterly split?\"——IFT 结果 预先回答了这个问题。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S-IFT: IFT vs MH concordance matrix + split date distribution'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S-IFT: Split date histogram + effect size gradient over time'\n  analysis: 'Appendix robustness check。Best 档下 serves dual purpose：(1) validates binary\n    split choice, (2) shows continuous treatment produces consistent findings。 一句话在\n    main text 引用：\"Item-Focused Trees with continuous temporal covariate confirm 81%\n    concordance with binary MH-DIF (Appendix X).\"\n\n    '\n- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: Decoder-only subpopulation DIF：移除 architecture heterogeneity 后检查 IRT\n    fit 和 DIF stability\n  expected_results:\n    total_models: 5227\n    decoder_only_models: 5226\n    non_decoder_models: 1\n    decoder_only_pct: 99.98\n    c_pct_full: 31.3\n    c_pct_decoder_only: 31.3\n    jaccard_full_vs_decoder_only: 1.0\n    irt_fit_rmsea_full: 0.052\n    irt_fit_rmsea_decoder_only: 0.052\n    irt_fit_change: negligible — 1 model removal cannot affect fit\n    architecture_confound: non-issue\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 architecture stratification 是 trivially resolved concern。METABENCH\n    MMLU 中 5226/5227 models 是 decoder-only (99.98%)，仅 1 个 non-decoder model。 移除 1\n    个 model 后 Jaccard=1.0 (DIF flags 完全不变)，IRT fit 变化 negligible (RMSEA 变化在 numerical\n    precision 内)。这不是因为 DIF 对 architecture robust， 而是因为 MMLU evaluation landscape 已经\n    homogeneously decoder-only。Reviewer concern \"IRT misfit comes from architecture\n    heterogeneity\" 被数据直接 refute： heterogeneity 不存在。IRT misfit (98% |Lz|>2) 的真实原因是\n    MMLU 的 57-subject multidimensionality，不是 architecture mix。Best 档下此实验用一句话报告。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '一句话 in main text 足矣：\"METABENCH MMLU is 99.98% decoder-only (5,226/5,227);\n    excluding the single non-decoder model leaves DIF flags unchanged (Jaccard=1.0).\"\n    Proactively closes architecture heterogeneity concern。\n\n    '\n- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 已知 ground truth 的 semi-synthetic contamination injection：500 clean\n    items 中注入 100-200 items 的 differential contamination，测量 DIF detection power\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_external_tpr_p0_baseline: 0.326\n    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.99\n    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.0\n    temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n    ability_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n    standard_mh_fpr_inflation_at_p10: 0.298→0.616\n    matching_variable_contamination_confirmed: true\n    cross_subject_matching_delta_fpr: 0.0\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 semi-synthetic 是 Claim 3 的核心 evidence。ΔTPR=+0.508 at\n    p=0.5 意味着在 50% exploitation rate 下，DIF detection power 增加 50.8 个百分点—— 从 baseline\n    32.6% (already-existing DIF) 到 83.4% (baseline + injected)。 Dose-response 单调递增\n    (p=0.3→0.5→0.7→1.0 对应 ΔTPR 逐步增加) 证明 detection power 与 contamination intensity\n    正相关，排除 artifact。 Cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.000 是 key methodological innovation——在所有\n    injection levels 下 FPR 完全不变，证明 cross-subject total score 作为 matching variable\n    不受 target-subject contamination 污染。对比 standard MH matching (within-subject score)\n    FPR 从 0.298 膨胀到 0.616，直接 demonstrate matching variable contamination problem。这个\n    ΔFPR=0.000 vs 0.186 inflation 的 contrast 是 reviewer 接受 Claim 3 的关键——它既是 methodological\n    contribution 又是 practical recommendation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 2 (main): Semi-synthetic ΔTPR across exploitation rates p ∈ {0.3, 0.5,\n    0.7, 1.0} — cross-subject vs standard matching'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2: Dose-response curve (exploitation rate vs ΔTPR) with cross-subject\n    (solid) vs standard (dashed) matching + FPR inflation panel'\n  analysis: 'Main text Claim 3 核心 evidence。Best 档下 reviewer 视 cross-subject matching\n    (ΔFPR=0.000) 为 \"practical methodological innovation worth reporting\"——subtle insight\n    that within-subject matching contaminates the conditioning variable, with clean\n    empirical demonstration。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n  plan_id: plan_028\n  description: 6-benchmark cross-validation：MMLU, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA, ARC-Challenge,\n    GSM8K, HellaSwag 上的 temporal DIF (2023 vs 2024)\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_c_pct: 31.3\n    mmlu_random_c_pct: 0.18\n    mmlu_enrichment: 174\n    winogrande_c_pct: 30.3\n    winogrande_random_c_pct: 0.32\n    winogrande_enrichment: 95\n    truthfulqa_c_pct: 29.7\n    truthfulqa_random_c_pct: 0.37\n    truthfulqa_enrichment: 80\n    arc_c_pct: 26.9\n    arc_random_c_pct: 0.6\n    arc_enrichment: 45\n    gsm8k_c_pct: 18.9\n    gsm8k_random_c_pct: 0.3\n    gsm8k_enrichment: 63\n    hellaswag_c_pct: 17.9\n    hellaswag_random_c_pct: 0.28\n    hellaswag_enrichment: 64\n    cross_benchmark_range: 17.9-31.3%\n    all_random_below_1pct: true\n    min_enrichment_ratio: 45\n    n_benchmarks: 6\n  result_rationale: \"Best 档的 single most important new result。6 benchmarks 全部 C% ≥\\\n    \\ 17.9%， all ≥45× above random control，彻底封堵 \\\"only MMLU\\\" 攻击面。 C% 变异 (17.9-31.3%)\\\n    \\ 反映 benchmark structural differences： - MMLU (31.3%) 最高因为 57 subjects 覆盖最广，items\\\n    \\ 最多 (12,508)，temporal\\n  capability shift 有更多 dimensions 可以 manifest as DIF。\\n\\\n    - WinoGrande (30.3%) 和 TruthfulQA (29.7%) 接近 MMLU 因为它们测试 commonsense\\n  reasoning\\\n    \\ 和 factual knowledge——这些 domains 在 2023→2024 变化大 (GPT-4,\\n  Llama-2→3 的主要 capability\\\n    \\ jumps 集中在 reasoning/knowledge)。\\n- ARC-Challenge (26.9%) 中等——science reasoning\\\n    \\ 有 capability jump 但\\n  item pool 较小 (1,172) 限制了 DIF detection power。\\n- GSM8K\\\n    \\ (18.9%) 和 HellaSwag (17.9%) 最低因为：GSM8K 是 math word problems，\\n  solution structure\\\n    \\ 更 formulaic，item functioning 更 stable across generations；\\n  HellaSwag 是 commonsense\\\n    \\ NLI，10,042 items 但 item difficulty variance 较低\\n  (多数 items 在 easy-to-medium\\\n    \\ range)，DIF effect size 被 compressed。\\nAll random controls <1% 证明 MH-DIF 的 type\\\n    \\ I error 在所有 benchmarks 上 well-calibrated。45× minimum enrichment (ARC) 使得 \\\"\\\n    DIF flags are noise\\\" 攻击面不可行。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 3 (main): 6-benchmark cross-validation summary — N_items, N_ref, N_foc,\n    C%, random C%, enrichment ratio'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 3: Cross-benchmark C% bar chart with random control overlay + enrichment\n    ratio annotations'\n  analysis: 'Best 档 cornerstone result。一张 summary table + 一个 figure panel (per paper_framing\n    plan_028 压缩要求)。This single result upgrades the paper from \"interesting MMLU analysis\"\n    to \"generalizable finding about LLM benchmarks as a class\"。Reviewer avg score\n    从 ~3.5 推到 4.0+ 主要来自此 result。\n\n    '\n- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n  plan_id: plan_029\n  description: 1000× permutation test：随机重分配 2023/2024 temporal labels，建立 C% null distribution\n  expected_results:\n    n_permutations: 1000\n    null_c_pct_mean: 0.21\n    null_c_pct_sd: 0.09\n    null_c_pct_max: 0.58\n    null_c_pct_p999: 0.52\n    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n    z_score: 345.4\n    empirical_p_value: <0.001 (0/1000 permutations exceed observed)\n    effect_size_vs_null: 148× above null mean\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 permutation null 提供比 random-split control (0.18%) 更严格的\n    statistical test。Random split 是 within-cohort 随机分组——它控制的是 \"same temporal window\n    内 MH 是否产生 spurious DIF\"。Permutation test 是 across-cohort label shuffling——它控制的是\n    \"temporal label assignment 本身是否与 DIF 有关\"。 Null C% mean=0.21% (vs random split\n    0.18%) 几乎相同因为两者本质上都在测试 \"ability distribution overlap 能否产生 spurious DIF\"——当 labels\n    被 permute， 两组 ability distributions 变得 exchangeable，MH 的 ability conditioning\n    使得 spurious DIF 接近 zero。SD=0.09% 说明 null distribution 非常 concentrated， max=0.58%\n    说明即使最极端的 permutation 也远低于 1%。Z=345 (>200σ) 使得 p<10^{-100} level significance。Best\n    档 reviewer 看到 permutation test 后不再质疑 \"is 31% above chance?\"——问题 definitively closed。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S-Perm: Permutation null distribution summary statistics'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S-Perm: Null C% histogram with observed 31.3% marked (off-scale)'\n  analysis: 'Main text 一句话引用，full results in appendix。\"Permutation test (1,000 iterations)\n    yields null C%=0.21±0.09%, observed 31.3% is >200σ above null (p<0.001).\" 与 random\n    split 0.18% 互补——两种 null construction 给出 一致结论。Best 档下 reviewer 接受 binary split\n    因为 permutation test demonstrates temporal labels carry genuine signal。\n\n    '\n- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: Odds ratio + Simpson's paradox 分析：domain-level vs item-level accuracy\n    delta 对 DIF flag 的 logistic regression，McFadden/Nagelkerke R², OR + 95% CI\n  expected_results:\n    model1_domain_delta:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n      subject_acc_delta_or_ci:\n      - 1.19\n      - 2.03\n      interpretation: domains with larger 2024-2023 accuracy improvement have slightly\n        MORE DIF — naïve positive association\n    model2_domain_delta_plus_items:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n      subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 0.73\n      ctt_difficulty_or_per_010: 0.78\n      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n      interpretation: SIMPSON'S PARADOX — after controlling for item difficulty and\n        discrimination, domain improvement NEGATIVELY predicts DIF\n    model3_item_delta:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n      item_acc_change_ci:\n      - 1.51\n      - 2.96\n    model4_item_delta_plus_items:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n      item_acc_change_or_per_010: 0.92\n      ctt_difficulty_or_per_010: 0.77\n      ctt_discrimination_or_per_010: 1.54\n    simpsons_paradox: true\n    simpsons_or_flip: 1.55 → 0.73\n    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 646.98\n    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档的 second most important new result。Simpson''s paradox (OR\n    1.55→0.73) 是 \"ability confound doesn''t drive DIF\" 的最强 evidence。 机制：Model 1 只看\n    domain-level accuracy delta → OR=1.55，因为 capability improvement 大的 domains 确实有更多\n    DIF items (ρ=0.307 ecological correlation)。 但 Model 2 加入 item-level difficulty\n    和 discrimination 后 → OR=0.73 REVERSES。 这是因为 DIF-C items 本身有 specific item properties\n    (harder: d=-0.247, higher discrimination: d=0.230, per plan_023)，这些 item properties\n    confound domain-level correlation。Controlling for item properties reveals that\n    domain improvement actually REDUCES DIF probability (OR=0.73 < 1.0)——domains with\n    larger improvement have FEWER DIF items after accounting for item characteristics。\n\n    R² 极低 (McFadden 0.0007→0.0423) 说明即使 best model 也只解释 ~4% variance ——96% of DIF\n    is item-specific, not explained by domain improvement OR item properties。这 reinforces\n    plan_019 的 \"≤2.4pp/7.6%\" 结论 via 完全不同的 statistical framework (logistic regression\n    vs decomposition)，形成 converging evidence。\n\n    Best 档 reviewer 看到 Simpson''s paradox reversal 后接受 \"DIF is not driven by capability\n    improvement\"——这是一个 well-known statistical phenomenon， reviewers 理解其 implications。LR\n    test χ²=647 (p≈0) 证明 item properties 是 genuine confounders，不是 noise。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 4 (main): 4-model logistic regression comparison — predictors, OR [95%\n    CI], McFadden R², LR test'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4: Simpson''s paradox visualization — domain-level OR=1.55 (positive slope)\n    vs item-controlled OR=0.73 (negative slope)'\n  analysis: Main text Claim 1 的 second pillar (alongside plan_019 decomposition)。\n    Simpson's paradox 比 R²=0.0007 更直观——reviewer 可能不理解 \"pseudo R² 解释 0.07% variance\"，但一定理解\n    \"association REVERSES after controlling for confounders\"。Best 档下此 figure 是 paper\n    中 most memorable visualization—— 两条相反方向的 regression slopes in the same plot。\n","numLines":586,"startLine":1,"totalLines":586}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01J4Z1vDWBMv8iNW8vth2i4i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've read the full paper (8 pages) and the review context. Now I need to set up the full review process:\n\n1. Dispatch R1 (methods + experiments) and R2 (novelty + related work) as independent agents\n2. Then run the roundtable: Step 1 independent → Step 2 cross-share → Step 3 converge → Step 4 synthesize\n3. Submit the final review report\n\nLet me set up the task list and dispatch both reviewers in parallel.\n\nLet me first organize my understanding of the paper:\n\n**Title:** \"How Stable Are LLM Benchmarks? Psychometric DIF Analysis of 5,227 Models Reveals 31% Temporal Item Instability\"\n\n\nThe paper makes four key contributions: a large-scale empirical finding that 31.3% of MMLU items exhibit significant temporal differential item functioning across models, with the instability being item-specific rather than threatening overall ranking validity; a meta-analysis showing that web-overlap contamination labels don't correlate with DIF patterns; a semi-synthetic validation approach using TPR/FPR matching to verify their methodology; and a practical audit protocol for benchmark maintainers. The experiments span multiple benchmarks and testing corrections, with detailed analysis of temporal trends. I'm noting a few additional analyses that were considered but ultimately excluded—the bifactor IRT equating approach was ruled out due to scope constraints, item generation calibration wasn't executed, and the cumulative Bayesian DIF analysis either didn't make it into the appendix or its status is unclear. Now I'm ready to bring in both reviewers.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25658,"cache_read_input_tokens":24182,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25658},"ou