{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y6Ap3oF995yGxyLxGuKRX7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- plan_015_bifactor_irt: Bifactor IRT（1 general + 57 subject-specific factors）的 general θ 分层能将 temporal cohort baseline FPR 从 31% 降至 <15%，同时在 semi-synthetic 框架下保持 TPR>0.60 at p=0.5。Bifactor 通过分离学科特异性能力和通用能力，消除 subject-level 能力差异对 MH-DIF 的混淆。（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **plan_028_multi_bench_dif** (success): Temporal DIF (2023 vs 2024 cohort) 在 METABENCH 的 ARC, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA 上均展现与 MMLU 类似的显著 C% (>15%)，证明 temporal DIF 现象跨 benchmark 泛化，不是 MMLU 特有的 artifact。所有 benchmark 的 random-split control C% < 1%。 ← 基于 plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n  [plan_028_multi_bench_summary](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_028_multi_bench_dif/data/multi_bench_summary.csv) | [plan_028_multi_bench_report](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_028_multi_bench_dif/report/multi_bench_dif_report.md) | [plan_028_script](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_028_multi_bench_dif/intermediate/plan_028_multi_bench_dif.py)\\\\n- **plan_030_odds_ratio** (success): Logistic regression 的 odds ratio + CI 量化 accuracy change 与 DIF C flag 的关联强度。Item-level accuracy change (Model 3) 比 domain-level delta (Model 1) 提供更精确的预测。控制 item properties (difficulty + discrimination) 后，accuracy change 的 OR 反转（Simpson's paradox），说明 DIF C 主要由 item 固有属性驱动而非 accuracy shift。 ← 基于 plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n  [plan_030_odds_ratio_report](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_030_odds_ratio/report/odds_ratio_report.md) | [plan_030_odds_ratio_script](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/plan_030_odds_ratio/intermediate/plan_030_odds_ratio.py)\\\\n- **plan_027_temporal_overlap** (success): Temporal cohort ability gap 很小 (d=-0.17)，ability-matched C% 接近 full 31.3%，确认 temporal DIF 非 ability confound 产物 ← 基于 plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 8 / 负向 6 / 失败 0 / 共 14\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\n（无服务器配置）\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2024, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Fdr2fU5eExvVwpU6wag8xZ","session_id":"08c58412-17e2-4f74-8c66-bef7dc33333c","uuid":"8b3b4160-cfa2-4e9a-a14c-df726b20f040","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:46:25.985Z"}
